CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/al com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/Tree
	COMMENT Tree - the tree/obstacle NonGameUnit (palm_tree / trees / trees_snow sprites). Own fields: a (static BitmapOrTexture[3] resource cache), b (static palm_leaves), c (image), d (type: 0 palm, 1 normal tree, 2 snow tree), e (subType 0-4, variable drawn as "type.subType" on the map), f (current frame), g (frame timer, +1 frame per 5 ticks), h (chopped down), i (damage carry-over, decays), j/k (frame offsets into the spritesheet), l (draw scale, randomised at creation), m (draw mirrored). Inherited Unit fields used: radius (cj), hp/maxHp (cu/cv), angle (cg), dead (bV), deathTime (bW). a(Unit,float) scales the damage by the attacker's Unit.bN() damage output; k() is the death routine that spawns the EffectObject debris burst. [field names verified from code]
